  "ai_summary": "Recent sharp drops\u2014IT consultancy stocks plunging 15.75% in 30 days on top of a 27.05% yearly loss as markets price in automation\u2014contrast with broader resilience. Despite a mild 3.5% yearly dip in Big Tech headcount, Indeed software developer postings jumped 20.1% over the year and rose 1.75% in the last 30 days. Meanwhile, Anthropic added 46 jobs recently. Devs aren't broadly cooked yet, though low-end outsourcing faces severe disruption. The market is pricing in total AI automation, which is rich coming from an industry whose codebases are held together by duct tape, prayer, and 12-year-old Stack Overflow threads.",
